WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Welcome to Jol — your community-powered guide to safer streets.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Start on Live map. Choose your city, then scan nearby reports at a glance.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Use filters for passable, caution, and blocked reports. Toggle Traffic view or recenter on My location.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Tap Report a flood and upload a clear street-level photo. Include a kerb, tyre, car wheel, or shin when possible.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Jol compares the water level with visible reference objects to estimate depth.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Review the depth and route status, then publish the report so neighbors can see it.

00:30.000 --> 00:35.000
Check conditions before leaving, report what you see, and stay safe around moving water.
